<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- A code list of the UBL example world: transport means type. The kind of vehicle, vessel, aircraft or installation that carries goods. The descriptions name the nearest code of UNECE Recommendation 28 where its published list has one; the world's own list is used because the codes of Recommendation 28 for barges, trucks with trailers and pipelines could not be checked against a published copy. Made by tools/build_codelists.py from world/codelists/lists.json. -->
